Share: `baby-development/_work/2026-11/digests-age-reread/share-12.md`. Yes posts: 27. Near posts: 13.

<!-- All 40 supplied posts were read whole; none were left unread. Counts describe this supplied share, not prevalence in the market. Per-post tags appear in comments after each Posts line, in the order tried / others / bought / feeling. Tried means a described action already taken about the situation or the child's relevant care, not a plan or a position alone. Others means a reported statement or action by someone other than the speaker. Bought requires an identified acquisition or booking, not merely using a product or mentioning a service, proposed purchase or estimated price. Feeling requires a named feeling of the speaker, not only the child or another adult. Unknown speaker sex is not inferred; form headings use "the parent" or "the speaker". -->

